==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|fr|microbe}}, from {{der|en|grc|μικρός|t=small}} and {{m|grc|βίος|t=life}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈmaɪkɹoʊb/|a=US}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-microbe.ogg|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|microbiology}} Any [[microorganism]]; {{lb|en|loosely|nonscientifically}} especially, a [[harmful]] [[bacterium]].

